<title>UK: Higher prices sidelined UK meals and feeds buyers.</title>
<headline>Higher prices sidelined UK meals and feeds buyers.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Higher prices sidelined buyers on the UK meals and feeds market on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;Chicago was up on the project &quot;A&quot; trading and again this afternoon which has put buyers off,&quot; said one broker.</p>
<p>High protein soymeal offers were around three stg up ex-mill while store prices were one to two stg up.</p>
<p>In the rest of market, rapemeal, sunflowermeal, sunpellets and corn gluten were all unchanged.</p>
<p>--Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom, +44 171 542 8062</p>
